<title>USA: BioTransplant says gets four patents.</title>
<headline>BioTransplant says gets four patents.</headline>
<dateline>CHARLESTOWN, Mass. 1996-10-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>BioTransplant Inc said on Monday it had received notices of allowance for four patent applications covering key parts of its AlloMune and XenoMune systems.</p>
<p>The systems facilitate the transplantation of mismatched human and porcine organs.</p>
<p>The U.S. Patent and Trademark Office granted three of the patent allowances, with the fourth granted by the Australian Patent Office, BioTransplant said.</p>
<p>--New York Newsdesk, 212-859-1733</p>
